SimCameraInjector

The Objective-C sources in this directory (everything except build.sh,
NOTICE and LICENSE) are copied from serve-sim
(https://github.com/EvanBacon/serve-sim, packages/serve-sim/Sources/
SimCameraInjector at commit a30d70a55e05654d974c86803b68d4f675be77e3,
serve-sim 0.1.46), Copyright Evan Bacon, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).

Modifications by SimUtil: the fake camera names (SimCamFakes.m), its
manufacturer (SimCamFakes.m) and the fallback image text
(SimCamFrameSource.m) say SimUtil instead of serve-sim.

SimUtil builds them into libSimCameraInjector.dylib (build.sh, run by the
Runner target) and ships it in the macOS app bundle's Resources. The
host-side feed in ../Runner/SimCameraFeed.m is adapted from serve-sim's
Sources/SimCameraHelper/main.m.
